  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">El objetivo del programa es proveer de mecanismos adecuados para el financiamiento de infraestructuras productivas a traves del Banco de la Republica Oriental del Uruguay.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective of the program is to provide appropriate mechanisms for productive infrastructure financing through the National Bank, BROU.</narrative>
